Lab Material
Lab 9: Backup and Restore VMs using OADP
Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Install and configure the OpenShift APIs for Data Protection (OADP) operator
Deploy and configure Velero for VM backup operations
Create backup policies for OpenShift Virtualization workloads
Perform backup operations for virtual machines and their associated data
Execute restore operations to recover VMs from backup storage
Validate backup and restore functionality in an OpenShift environment
Implement best practices for VM data protection using open-source tools
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, ensure you have:

Basic understanding of OpenShift Container Platform concepts
Familiarity with OpenShift Virtualization and virtual machine management
Knowledge of Kubernetes resources (pods, services, persistent volumes)
Experience with command-line interface (CLI) operations
Understanding of backup and restore concepts
